    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a well-positioned large level site, apx .1 acre in an excellent location equi- distance between Mullingar & Kinnegad yet close to schools & a short distance to M4. \r\n\r\nIdeal for the construction of a private residence, Subject to Planning. Local needs Criteria apply.\r\n\r\nThe site offers the perfect balance of country living while remaining within easy reach of a range of local amenities, \r\n\r\nThe site is zoned Rural/Agricultural under Westmeath Co Co Development Plan, as such it is expected to be of particular interest to purchasers who satisfy the Local Needs Criteria of Westmeath Co. Co planning department.\r\n\r\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz.ie to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\r\n\r\nSpecial Features\r\n• 10Km West of Kinnegad\r\n• 11Km East of Mullingar\r\n• A short distance South of M4 DISTANCE SOUTH OF M4, Coralstown School & Mary Lynch’s Pub & Restaurant"
      }
